{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084550/extras/03ac715b808c533d4ff327340e25a0a8.avif?t=1761637982\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have you ever wanted to parry\u2014purely, endlessly, beautifully?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hajiki</i> is a minimalist samurai duel game built entirely around the art of the parry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084550/extras/2f4ed58f4d5f3c78eaa0f4051acd2f96.avif?t=1761637982\" width=1560 height=872 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084550/extras/e166c5b98721fe48227bc8dd682d43c3.avif?t=1761637982\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply tilt your right stick or move your mouse to block incoming strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple to play, but incredibly hard to master \u2014 a perfect test of timing and focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each successful parry sharpens your senses, pulling you deeper into a meditative flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in Japan\u2019s warring states era, two warriors face each other in a life-or-death duel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combos. No attacks. Only perfect defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084550/extras/824bbc5e0c07da0c0e4cafe6883e97d7.avif?t=1761637982\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep parrying to earn titles of mastery \u2014 from \u201cExpert\u201d to \u201cDemon\u201d to \u201cShura.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you reach the ultimate flow state?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79 Stick \u2026\u2026\u00a0 Parry Input (Up / Down / Left / Right)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddb1 Mouse \u2026\u2026\u00a0 Parry Input (Up / Down / Left / Right)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01O key / \u2b58\uff08PS\uff09 \u2026\u2026\u00a0 Retry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe0 Start Button \u2026\u2026 Return to Title</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41 C key / \u25a1\uff08PS\uff09 \u2026\u2026\u00a0 Switch View Mode</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u9054\u4eba","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4084550/fccc0731b20e587a1abd0c2e6434af932c626826.jpg"},{"name":"\u4fee\u7f85","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4084550/fb8e9602a7e9e56725772f66710528d3d25dc388.jpg"},{"name":"\u9b3c","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4084550/52e9a7b29dc76674be5ce4d1169879fa23c40d7c.jpg"},{"name":"\u5230\u9054","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4084550/5ab87eefc6c28ced6762aaa13709aaf569d349b5.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4084550?t=1761637982","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4084550?t=1761637982","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084550/297bc4422abeba0739e1c25f72e11201334404ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761637982","ca